Z||000044||qwikgta||09-07-2001||09:30 PM||||Minn...No prob, its just funny cause' everyone "here" says the samething about the lights not having a finished look, I agree but I had no idea what else to do.  I was about to put mine back to stock and then you went and did this.  I am going out tomorrow to HomeD or Lowes to get some parts to do what you did.  I have been thinking about it all day.  <P>As for the bulbs...I am not sure where to get them.  I have seen the ones we need (1157/2157 or something like this) in some car mags..like sport compact car or maybe a lowrider/truckin mag.  They had like 12 little LEDs in a tight ring and looked like they would fit right inside the light socket.  I remember the price being high like $8-12 each and I was not going to spend $35-50 on bulbs, I may now.   Thanks for exploring new ideas.  Good luck<P>Rob||||reg||1
